d-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A viscous material applicator, comprising a main body (3) provided with a pressurizing room (3c) communicating with a discharge outlet (4a) and storing therein a viscous material (5), a viscous material supply means (1) for supplying the viscous material (5) to the pressurizing room (3c), and discharge pressure regulating means (2, 3b) which regulate a viscous material (5) discharge pressure by decreasing/increasing the volume of the room (3c) when the viscous material (5) in the room (3c) is discharged under pressure and which are disposed facing the room (3c) or the main body (3).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un applicateur de matière visqueuse comprenant un corps principal (3) pourvu d'une chambre de pressurisation (3c) communiquant avec une sortie de décharge (4a) et contenant une matière visqueuse (5), un dispositif (1) d'apport de matière visqueuse pour distribuer la matière visqueuse (5) dans la chambre de pressurisation (3c), et un dispositif (2, 3b) de régulation de la pression de décharge qui régule la pression de décharge d'une matière visqueuse (5) en augmentant/diminuant le volume de la chambre (3c) lorsque la matière visqueuse (5) contenue dans la chambre (3c) est déchargée sous pression, disposés en face de la chambre (3c) ou du corps principal (3).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>